+# Final review: cluster 21 (tests-fixtures), epic ht-ma6i
+
+Source: base cf13ed76c1c2871b321ad290d03229cb785c400e, head 0755e609de0328e6d73584dd65eb2854e1fd7bf7. Both resolved as commits. The caller checkout was at the head commit with a clean status when read.
